<title>USA: NYSE delists two Integrated Health notes.</title>
<headline>NYSE delists two Integrated Health notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said it suspended and plans to delist Integrated Health Services Inc's 9-5/8 percent senior subordinated notes due 2002 and 10-3/4 percent senior subordinated notes due 2004.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Integrated Health said it completed a tender offer for the note issues.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
